<Slide notes={`回看第三章，真正重要的变化不是多了几个模型角色，而是每一项结果都有了明确的来源。

陈晨想去阅读室，这是 Brain 的决定；他能不能走过去，由空间与动作校验决定；他实际走到了哪里，由已提交的事实记录；回放画面展示的内容，则由这些事实重建。

这条链一旦理清楚，出问题的时候就知道该往哪一层查：是决定错了，是校验拦住了，是提交没有发生，还是展示读了不该读的东西。

这一节要把这条链完整走一遍，再把它整理成一份别人能检查、能复现的交付材料。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>第三章　在共同世界中行动　·　3.14　沿着一次行动理解架构，整理可交付的实验</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 32 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 560, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>沿着一次行动{'\n'}理解架构</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.7, width: 560 }}>把 3.1—3.13 串成一条链：谁决定、谁校验、谁提交、谁展示。每一项结果都要能说出它的来源。</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 4 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 128, height: 42, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>五个职责</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 128, height: 42, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#276FBF' }}>提交边界</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 128, height: 42, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#26816B' }}>事实回放</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 128, height: 42, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CB6B28' }}>交付物</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 560, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', marginBottom: 10 }}>一次行动，四个环节各留一笔</Text>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 72, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>决</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>Brain 决定：去阅读室</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>目标来自实际上下文与感知</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#276FBF' }}>↓</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 72, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>校</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>空间与动作校验</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>能不能走过去，由这一层决定</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#26816B' }}>↓</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 72, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>提</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>已提交事实记录</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>走到了哪里，只有这一层说了算</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#26816B' }}>↓</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 72, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>放</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>回放重建画面</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>读已提交事实，不重新执行模型</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.14 沿着一次行动理解架构，整理可交付的实验</Text>
